  "details": "What if I dont need to tag my instance and define a VIBE, that's a lot for when I'm worldhopping by myself.\n\nIf I don't need to set a Title, Description, Category, Vibe, and Language, I want to swap to a Quick Mode that just leaves those settings blank and lets me get to the world already instead of spending a solid minute or two setting little social options. \n\nWithout this feature, instance creation would cause so much friction that I might stop rapidly worldhopping to find new cool content amidst the already horrible discovery crisis.",
